00:00:12.737 --> 00:00:14.010
(laughs)

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:17.530
I mean I think my mom, my
mom was so afraid for me.

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:20.930
Like she was just like,
"You are too distracted.

00:00:20.930 --> 00:00:24.850
