energy to be on the highway."

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:26.440
And so I was like, "Yeah,
you're probably right.

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:27.420
You're probably right."

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:32.100
But then I was like, I think
I, I spent so much time

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.920
like feeling like I was
like really, really young.

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:36.400
